      "likeCount": 5,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6144200303f31b42ea7c8958",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 5
      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also, when you're playing on a Rift, you can't see what the icon is with your 1200p screen and your resolution scale at 60% because you're in Shelter and there's 70 people in the room\nThe \"Fallback\" text could be changed to \"Filesize too large\", or \"Perf. Blocked\" and so on.\nReplacing the identical looking feather icons with ones that showcase the smaller but MUCH MORE IMPORTANT actual status icon, and making the feather into a badge in the corner of that would already be a huge improvement.\nWhen UI 1.5 drops, the player-select hand menu should show the fallback status and why the avatar was blocked.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-09-17T04:56:35.563Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "(Sorry, I'm using Deepl translation)\nIn the community among VRChat Quest users in Japan, people often upload their own avatars with Very Poor Rank, and there is a culture of teaching beginners how to Show Avatar.\nWith the September 16 update, the Fallback Avatar specification has been changed, and whereas until now you could tell if a robot was PC Only or Very Poor by the thumbnail on the robot's chest\nIt is now necessary to open the menu and check the incomprehensible shit icon, making it difficult for beginners to understand.\nCan you please change the avatar of Very Poor back to the old robot?\n- Here is the original text\n日本のVRChat Questユーザー間のコミュニティでは、自分専用のアバターを Very Poor Rank でアップロードすることが多く、Show Avatar の方法を初心者に教える文化があります。\n9月16日のアップデートで、Fallback Avatar の仕様が変更されてしまい、今までは、ロボットの胸元にサムネイルが表示されているかでPC Only か Very Poor かの判別ができていたのに対し、\nメニューを開いて、わかりづらいアイコンを確認することが必要になり、初心者にとって分かりづらい状態になってしまっています。\nVery Poor のアバターだけでも、以前のロボットに戻していただけないでしょうか？",
